# Final Summary

The central purpose of Data Engineering is to transform data from multiple operational sources into reliable, secure, well-modeled, and accessible data products.

A common conceptual workflow is:

```text
Source Systems
      |
      v
Ingestion
      |
      v
Raw / Bronze
      |
      v
Cleaned / Silver
      |
      v
Curated / Gold
      |
      v
Facts and Dimensions
      |
      v
BI | Analytics | Data Science | Applications
```

The most important skills are not tied to a single vendor. They include understanding data sources, building dependable incremental pipelines, modeling facts and dimensions, handling historical changes, validating data quality, securing access, monitoring failures, and explaining architectural trade-offs.

Azure services such as Data Factory, ADLS Gen2, Event Hubs, Databricks, Synapse Analytics, and Power BI are tools that implement different parts of this broader architecture.

